      "text": "Yup",
      "quote": {
        "author": "XFreeze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876785200010539008/2_HFJjq9_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-16 13:04:06",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-16T05:04:06.000Z",
        "id": "2122193972722573371",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXOMKmBbQAADlGZ.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1800,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXOMKmBbQAADlGZ.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 3200
          }
        ],
        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "In 2014, NASA awarded Boeing $4.2 BILLION to develop Starliner\n\nSpaceX received just $2.6 BILLION for Crew Dragon\n\nNow look at the results:\n\n• Boeing Starliner: Just one crewed flight and got two astronauts stuck on the ISS for over 9 months in space before SpaceX sent Dragon to rescue them\n\n• SpaceX Crew Dragon: 21 crewed missions since 2020, carrying astronauts to orbit for NASA and private customers, saving NASA billions of dollars\n\nBoeing received $1.6 BILLION more in the original NASA contract\n\nYet SpaceX ended up bringing Boeing's own astronauts back to Earth",
        "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2122193972722573371",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
